{"title":"1967 AHSME Problems/Problem 17","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1967_AHSME_Problems/Problem_17&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/c/adc143c3f887fa7e92fd80d91bb22af51b4abd77.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r_1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"17\" height=\"13\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/b/4/0b4f3f4b698ce35667432041e168f7653533fa7b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r_2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"17\" height=\"13\" /> are the distinct real roots of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/c/bcc597fd9d54e816877f37ff786977af41d038d7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^2+px+8=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"123\" height=\"18\" />, then it must follow that:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/b/9/9b93024206ee6164a45b5991624fcd463a7e84b8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ |r_1+r_2|&gt;4\\sqrt{2}\\qquad \\textbf{(B)}\\ |r_1|&gt;3 \\; \\text{or} \\; |r_2| &gt;3 \\\\ \\textbf{(C)}\\ |r_1|&gt;2 \\; \\text{and} \\; |r_2|&gt;2\\qquad \\textbf{(D)}\\ r_1&lt;0 \\; \\text{and} \\; r_2&lt;0\\qquad \\textbf{(E)}\\ |r_1+r_2|&lt;4\\sqrt{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"580\" height=\"45\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1967_AHSME_Problems/Problem_17&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We are given that the roots are real, so the discriminant is positive, which means <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/d/f/1df3dfa4c47af748b2c74dc09bc033bc44b91aad.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p^2 - 4(8)(1) &gt; 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"128\" height=\"19\" />.  This leads to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/a/a/0aa8fc2f836310cc5467345342003c256b9f36a0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$|p| &gt; 4\\sqrt{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"77\" height=\"21\" />.  By Vieta, the sum of the roots is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/9/5/2952f74e24ccfcd852f9e389af3e1b0b2aecb2ec.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-p$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"23\" height=\"11\" />, so we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/2/8/92828c9472c8635d5470d9abd47e0f9f8110f702.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$|-(r_1 + r_2)| \\ge 4\\sqrt{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"158\" height=\"21\" />, or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/a/6/ba6e5b4ae5cd941c7d54a238782e884bf8263c15.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$|r_1 + r_2| &gt; 4\\sqrt{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"121\" height=\"21\" />, which is option <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/8/6/386255c1da145bc497cf598169ccbaa210e8d0cf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\fbox{A}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"24\" height=\"23\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1967_AHSME_Problems/Problem_17&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1967_AHSME\" title=\"1967 AHSME\">1967 AHSC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1967_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1967 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1967_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1967 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1967\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1967_AHSME_Problems/Problem_16\" title=\"1967 AHSME Problems/Problem 16\">Problem 16</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1967_AHSME_Problems/Problem_18\" title=\"1967 AHSME Problems/Problem 18\">Problem 18</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1967_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1967 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1967_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1967 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1967_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1967 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1967_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1967 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1967_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1967 AHSME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1967_AHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1967 AHSME Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1967_AHSME_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1967 AHSME Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1967_AHSME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1967 AHSME Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1967_AHSME_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"1967 AHSME Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1967_AHSME_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"1967 AHSME Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=196